IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. EVAL-TEST.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TEST PIC 9 VALUE 1.
01 SIZE-OF-APPART PIC 999 VALUE 270.
01 DESC PIC X(10).
01 WHATEVER PIC X VALUE "W".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EVALUATE WS-TEST
        WHEN 1
            DISPLAY "ONE".
        WHEN OTHER
            DISPLAY "NOT ONE".
    END-EVALUATE.
    EVALUATE SIZE-OF-APPART
        WHEN 50 THRU 100
            MOVE "TINY" TO DESC.
        WHEN 101 THRU 150
            MOVE "SMALL" TO DESC.
        WHEN 151 THRU 200
            MOVE "AVERAGE" TO DESC.
        WHEN  201 THRU 299
            MOVE "BIG" TO DESC.
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "LARGE" TO DESC.
    END-EVALUATE.
        DISPLAY DESC
    EVALUATE WHATEVER
        WHEN "M"
            DISPLAY 'M'.
        WHEN "S"
        WHEN "D"
        WHEN "W"
            DISPLAY 'S|D|W'.
    END-EVALUATE
    STOP RUN.
